    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4318" root="ثبج" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبَجَةٌ</span></b>  A thing <i>of the middling sort, between
good and bad:</i> (K, TA:) the fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> is affixed
because the word is changed from a subst. to an
epithet: it occurs in this sense applied to the contribution termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدَقَة</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبَجٌ</span>.)

